# Ghost buttons

Ghost buttons are outline-only. **Text color and border color must be the same.**

Use the `.btn-ghost` class, then set the color once (`text-white`, `text-navy`, etc.). The border uses `currentColor`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — faded border, full-opacity text
<Link className="border-[1.5px] border-white/55 text-white">Enrollment packet</Link>

// ✅ GOOD
<Link className="btn-ghost text-white px-[26px] py-4 font-heading font-semibold">
  Enrollment packet
</Link>
```

Do not pair `border-white/55` (or any other opacity) with a different text opacity.
